mcp-server-grafana (2.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of upstream grafana/mcp-grafana v2.3.0
    (fork: Vitexus/mcp-server-grafana, upstream base v2.3.0, synced 2026-11-16).
  * Build with golang-1.26-go from trixie-backports (upstream requires Go 1.26).
  * /usr/bin/mcp-server-grafana launcher: GRAFANA_READ_ONLY=true maps to
    --disable-write.
  * Add companion package mcprack-mcp-server-grafana registering the server in
    the local mcprack catalog.

